+
+5. **P1 — the tooltip is not pointer-only.** [plan:100](/home/greg/code/spideryarn2/.claude/worktrees/fbhf4svm-mode-header-and-gutter-icons/docs/plans/261002e-mode-corner-icons-and-gutter-icon-polish.md:100), [BlockLinkCard.tsx:391](/home/greg/code/spideryarn2/.claude/worktrees/fbhf4svm-mode-header-and-gutter-icons/src/web/BlockLinkCard.tsx:391). The delegated card intentionally opens immediately on keyboard focus and adds `aria-describedby`; only touch is excluded. Rewrite the plan as “mouse hover and keyboard focus, not touch,” preserve `focusin`/`focusout`, and add a gutter-control Tab test.
