+
+10. **P2 — Sketch is not “just a prop” in the current ownership shape.** [plan:78](/home/greg/code/spideryarn2/.claude/worktrees/fbhf4svm-mode-header-and-gutter-icons/docs/plans/261002e-mode-corner-icons-and-gutter-icon-polish.md:78), [SketchView.tsx:195](/home/greg/code/spideryarn2/.claude/worktrees/fbhf4svm-mode-header-and-gutter-icons/src/web/SketchView.tsx:195), [DiagramPanel.tsx:1526](/home/greg/code/spideryarn2/.claude/worktrees/fbhf4svm-mode-header-and-gutter-icons/src/web/DiagramPanel.tsx:1526). `OwnerSketch` owns `useSketch` and constructs the badge below `DiagramPanel`’s `ModeSurface`; data cannot be passed upward with an ordinary prop. Decide before building: either explicitly exempt and defer Sketch, or introduce a render-prop/owner wrapper that hands both body and badge to the surface while preserving the owner/visitor capability boundary.
+
+11. **P2 — preserve the failed-permalink state when consolidating hover rules.** [gutter.css:635](/home/greg/code/spideryarn2/.claude/worktrees/fbhf4svm-mode-header-and-gutter-icons/src/web/styles/gutter.css:635), [gutter.css:646](/home/greg/code/spideryarn2/.claude/worktrees/fbhf4svm-mode-header-and-gutter-icons/src/web/styles/gutter.css:646). Its destructive colour currently wins by equal specificity and later source order. Keep that ordering or exclude `.failed` from the orange rule. Consider applying the shared colour to `:focus-visible` as keyboard parity, while retaining `.block-chat.has` blue only at rest.
